              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *maḻai peyyāviṭṭāl nāṭṭiṉ poruḷātāram pātikkappaṭum.* — If it does not rain, the country's economy will suffer.]"
