          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மானியம் (māṉiyam) is listed in DEDR 4674 with Tamil maṇiyam, the office of a village headman, and māṉiyam, the rent-free land or payment he held: a grant from the state. Whether the word is native is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
